 Cleanup_UC∆Stash2
⍝ Removes the override established by `Initial_UC∆Stash2`, closes the temporary project and
⍝ removes its folder. Note that no project of the user was ever closed, so there is nothing
⍝ to re-open here.
 {}∆SetOpenProjects ⎕NULL
 :If 0<⎕NC'∆StashProject'
     {}0 ⎕SE.Cider.CloseProject¨∆StashProject[;1]
     ⎕EX'∆StashProject'
 :EndIf
 :If 0<⎕NC'∆StashDir'
     :If FilesAndDirs.IsDir ∆StashDir
         {}FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce ∆StashDir
     :EndIf
     ⎕EX'∆StashDir'
 :EndIf
⍝Done
